7: 	  precedence checklist.
8: 	- *What members see* is Phoenix's rendered message and thread name,
9: 	  including the `@everyone` line, through the shared Discord preview.
10: 	- Past items show their delivery evidence: display status and reason,
11: 	  checkpoint timestamps, Discord permalink, error detail, thread
12: 	  attempts, and which Suppression or Override applied. In-flight items
13: 	  read "posting…" with the checkpoints that have happened so far.
14: 	- Holiday notices open the same inspector read-only: no per-date
15: 	  actions. A future occurrence offers "skip this date" (a single-date
16: 	  Suppression) and "change copy for this date" (the override form
